  "direct_current_source_observations": [
    "CombatFeedback stores type and two positions; this payload has no target entity ID, damage amount or animation clock. Existing other channels may supply entity-bound geometry; this fact alone does not mean they are absent.",
    "Global hit path filters positive uncancelled Dynasty weapon/arrow sources and synthetic damage; not every third-party or vanilla weapon is covered by this path.",
    "Three-tick per-target feedback throttling and client128-particle budget bound delivery; they do not establish low-FPS readability or measured performance.",
    "Client feedback consumer reviewed here emits particles and sound calls; no body-animation or numeric/text render operation in this method. Existing visual renderer channels retain their own implemented subfeatures.",
    "Ordinary Qi IMMUNE feedback does not acquire a Boss grey-text requirement. Current dedicated Boss Immune row still retains grey-text/hum/no-control/spam acceptance.",
    "No audio played or newly recorded; sound enum reuse alone neither proves nor disproves subjective sound suitability."
  ],
